---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="You're in · LandControl" description="LandControl: development intelligence for the new land market." bodyClass="sub" noindex={true}>
<header class="wrap hero"><div class="grid">
  <p class="crumb"><a href="/">LandControl</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--red)">Founding access</span></p>
  <h1>You’re in. Here’s what happens <em>next.</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">Your payment is confirmed and Stripe has emailed a receipt. Within one working day you’ll get an email from contact@landcontrol.co.uk with your login and a short call booking link so we can load your first agreements with you.</p>
  <div class="facts"><div><span class="num">Day 1</span><span>Welcome email and login</span></div><div><span class="num">Week 1</span><span>Onboarding call, agreements loaded</span></div><div><span class="num">Always</span><span>Cancel from your Stripe portal, no questions</span></div></div>
</div></header>
<section class="wrap band"><div class="grid"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Meanwhile</p><h2>Start your list now.</h2><p class="lede">Every option, conditional contract, pre-emption or promotion right your business has taken since 8 June 2026. Grant date, grantor, title numbers, control period. That’s what we load first.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
